      "text": "b. If thereafter such cause is not shown or found, the Commissioner will issue a certificate in accordance with the notice. Any labor organization shown to have been authorized by a majority of the employees in an appropriate grouping or unit to act as their bargaining representative will be certified as the exclusive bargaining representative for the employees in such grouping or unit in accordance with section 3 of the Executive Order on City Employee Relations.",
